6951, "w": 0.6288807361045623, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The bar is starting as the lowest in 2007. It is about 15,000. However, It has been", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7481937111196177, "w": 0.8074005689929886, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "slowly rised up until 2011. Unfortunately, It is likely to decrease as 2009 during", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7765240611937553, "w": 0.8067673748782901, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2012 to 2013. Nevertheless, It has been surprisingly increased by 2016. In 2016,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8048544112678929, "w": 0.8068323756990023, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "It break new record In the chart. It could be about 21,000!", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8331848367848156, "w": 0.5840813297650549, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}